        <li><a href="#four-ways" class="hover:underline">The 4 ways provinces select people</a></li>
        <li><a href="#base-enhanced" class="hover:underline">Base vs enhanced nominations</a></li>
        <li><a href="#steps" class="hover:underline">How to get nominated by a province: 8 steps</a></li>
        <li><a href="#table" class="hover:underline">Province-by-province quick reference</a></li>
        <li><a href="#chances" class="hover:underline">How to raise your chances</a></li>
        <li><a href="#bc" class="hover:underline">Worked example: getting nominated by British Columbia</a></li>
        <li><a href="#after" class="hover:underline">After you are nominated</a></li>
        <li><a href="#mistakes" class="hover:underline">Mistakes and fraud warnings</a></li>
        <li><a href="#faq" class="hover:underline">FAQ</a></li>
      </ol>
