            <tr><td class="px-3 py-3 font-medium">Saskatchewan</td><td class="px-3 py-3">Employer-supported categories (Employer Position Assessment); International Skilled Worker EOI pool</td><td class="px-3 py-3">Mostly</td><td class="px-3 py-3">At least 50% of nominations for priority sectors; hospitality, trucking and retail capped at 25% with intake windows; EOI page shows no scheduled draws</td><td class="px-3 py-3"><a href="https://www.saskatchewan.ca/residents/moving-to-saskatchewan/live-in-saskatchewan/by-immigrating/saskatchewan-immigrant-nominee-program" {...ext}>saskatchewan.ca</a></td></tr>
