            <tr><td class="px-3 py-3 font-medium">Ontario</td><td class="px-3 py-3">Ontario Workforce Priority (OWP) EOI</td><td class="px-3 py-3">Yes (except self-employed physicians)</td><td class="px-3 py-3">Eight streams replaced by OWP (June 25); EOIs opened August 4; new REDI round for six regions (October)</td><td class="px-3 py-3"><a href="https://www.ontario.ca/page/2026-ontario-immigrant-nominee-program-updates" {...ext}>ontario.ca</a></td></tr>
