            <tr><td class="px-3 py-3 font-medium">Northwest Territories</td><td class="px-3 py-3">Employer-Driven Stream EOI ranking (employer registers, candidate completes survey)</td><td class="px-3 py-3">Yes</td><td class="px-3 py-3">Four EOI draws (March to September); next draw in early 2027</td><td class="px-3 py-3"><a href="https://www.immigratenwt.ca/expression-interest" {...ext}>immigratenwt.ca</a></td></tr>
